{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"itemModified:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSObject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"item","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"item","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The item involved in the operation.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/itemModified:"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/itemmodified:"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Subclasses should override this method to handle an item getting modified (method called internally by framework)"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"itemModified:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"itemModified:"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCArrayOfItemsSection(im)itemModified:","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"role":"symbol","title":"itemModified:"},"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection/itemModified:":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Subclasses should override this method to handle an item getting modified (method called internally by framework)"}],"title":"itemModified:","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/itemmodified:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"itemModified:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/itemModified:","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to represent an array"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of any kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"}}}